            "chunk_id": "semeval-8527",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:b9c3c7672e5fee551a9cf95c9a39aaefc2a728ffdddddf64e2fb926d1eefe8c3",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897118+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5",
            "text": "The lead locomotive of the train had a video camera that recorded the view in front of the train.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897118+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-8530",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-8530",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8530",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:9260787bd42fb2f741f407c8659a17b6f3e72719a4c3b392f6dda55a88a18a29",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897128+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5",
            "text": "A major product of the factory was decorative quarry glass which was mass-produced by moulding and printing, rather than hand-cutting and painting.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897128+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-8553",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-8553",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8553",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:0f2eec4a1043b30e0dbacdd0d307f72c3ea246abbcb621f14a2988ec7bf2d659",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897134+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5",
            "text": "Discussion took place on the function of this Committee.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897134+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-8897",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-8897",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8897",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:638a603588e84414f2b30dc38c5f055493f28ff4d7d23158f53267aa47ab5e45",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897139+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5",
            "text": "Insects that harm trees are often prey for a descent of woodpeckers, which, in turn benefits the birds that nest in the saved tree.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897139+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-9355",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-9355",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9355",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:13bf33cf2098c56302e72663bc78cc3b91195ba5d32650dc92ddf185bf030315",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897144+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5",
            "text": "In this marvelous book Smuts draws from years of painstaking field research in which she followed around a flange of chacma baboons in the Mateti Game Park in Zimbabwe.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897144+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-9377",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-9377",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9377",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:563a964c7634cfd246047d9bff09b21a973895bfbed97479c59249d46d2ac4e3",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897148+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5",
            "text": "They chose a shop that oven bakes the paint in a down draft paint booth.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897148+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-9680",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-9680",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9680",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:adf2333f9ee8b757ef5e0cbf5d9059c0f0112643dd3e4e9713b9d64104fc305a",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897149+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b5",
            "text": "Rising as it does, 8260 feet straight from the fertile plains of the North Island's finest dairying country, the mountain is clothed with primeval forest.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:23:35.897149+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b5-semeval-9981",
